  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Discovery and export now read the latest saved version (the common draft — identical to the published version when there are no pending edits), falling back to the published version when no draft exists. This makes unpublished content translatable end-to-end: never-published pages/blocks, and nested blocks that exist only in a pending draft of a published block, are now discovered, exported, and imported. Supersedes the 0.8.6-beta attempt, which only covered never-published content. Also from 0.8.6-beta: pages selected from the picker's search results show their unit count immediately.",
